1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,400
I press START. Current reaches the coil and K1 pulls in.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,900
K1 also closes an auxiliary contact, across START.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,400
Now I let go of START.

4
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:18,900
Current flows through the auxiliary contact. K1 holds itself in.

5
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,000
STOP breaks the circuit. K1 drops out and the contact opens.

6
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:29,900
The motor stays off until someone presses START again.

7
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:36,900
START closes, STOP breaks, K1 holds itself.
